### Test 1: Save - Create (idempotent by externalDispatchId)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Order/save
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "externalDispatchId": "odoo-picking-77120",
  "orderNumber": "SO-45812",
  "locationId": 88123,
  "capacity": 12,
  "expectedDate": "2026-10-07T00:00:00",
  "timeWindowStart": "2026-10-07T08:00:00",
  "timeWindowEnd": "2026-10-07T12:00:00"
}

### Test 2: Save - Same dispatch again updates it
POST {{baseUrl}}/Order/save
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "externalDispatchId": "odoo-picking-77120",
  "capacity": 15
}

### Test 3: Save - Partial update by id
POST {{baseUrl}}/Order/save
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": 33120,
  "description": "Entregar en bodega trasera"
}

### Test 4: Save - Invalid (no location)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Order/save
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderNumber": "SO-1"
}

